{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b929a396-2f7b-8c87-8c70-12b28f194053",
  "created_at": "2026-02-22T10:48:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Deirdre Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:44:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:44:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, um, I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, so I figured this was the line for the storm stuff. Is this the right one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:44:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got it. That's what this line is for when the office is closed. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:44:58-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the low spot at the end of my block is under water. Like a foot, about. It's been building since, um, since the nor'easter came in Saturday and it finally wrapped up today. Hold on, sorry, I'm [pause] sorry, juggling things here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:45:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:45:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One Ocean Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side. The water's pooled right at the end of the block where it dips down. It's across the whole road, basically."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:45:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, one Ocean Avenue. Is it coming up toward any houses, or is it staying in the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:45:42-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Staying in the street so far. But, um, my neighbor, she's older, and she can't get out. Her driveway comes out right by that dip and she doesn't want to walk through it. She's not going anywhere like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:45:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Does she need anything right now, like medical help or a ride somewhere? Because if it's an emergency, that's a different number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:46:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, she's fine. She just can't get out. I checked on her this morning. I just wanted somebody to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:46:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, I'm glad you called. Do you see the storm drain in that spot? Is it covered with leaves or debris, or can't you tell with the water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:46:31-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can't really tell. There's, um, there's a lot of stuff floating around it. Branches, seaweed, I think. I'm not walking out in it. I'm in my pajamas, it's two in the afternoon, I haven't even gotten dressed today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:46:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a storm day, nobody's judging. I'll note debris possibly blocking the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:46:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Can I ask, do you know when they last came by? Like, did anybody check that spot during the storm or before it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:47:05-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at the log. [pause] I'm not seeing a crew entry for that block yet today. Crews have been out on the bigger roads first. I can flag yours as a low spot with water across the road and a resident who's stuck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:47:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And before the storm, is there a record of anyone cleaning it? I'm just wondering."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:47:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The entries I can see from here don't show a recent cleaning for that location. The office can pull the longer history on Monday, if you want that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:47:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'd be good. Just so I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:47:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back? I'd need a number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:47:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's four zero one, five five five, zero one nine four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:47:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one nine four. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:48:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Deirdre Doyle. D-E-I-R-D-R-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:48:08-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Deirdre. I'll put the ticket in as water over the roadway at the end of your block, possible clogged drain, elderly neighbor unable to leave. Until the water drops, I'd tell her to stay put, and keep your own car off that stretch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:48:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, we're not driving anywhere. Will somebody come today, do you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:48:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in the queue with the other flooding calls. Could be this afternoon, could be tomorrow morning, depending on how the tide and the rest of the list go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:48:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's fine. Thanks for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:48:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime. Stay dry, and call back here if the water starts heading toward a house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T10:48:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Bye."
    }
  ],
